[
  {
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "Follow the steps in this guide to update your installation of Ableton Live. Using the latest update to your version of Live is always recommended. Learn more about Live Minimum System Requirements.",
    "body_html_line": 1,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [],
    "id": "UPDATE-B001",
    "source_id": "HELP-UPDATING-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "Automatic updatesManual updatesSelecting the correct installerUpdating Live 11",
    "body_html_line": 1,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [],
    "id": "UPDATE-B002",
    "source_id": "HELP-UPDATING-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "Note: If you've used Live Beta and would like to transfer your preferences to an updated public release version of Live, you can copy them as explained in this guide: Using the Trial or Beta Preferences in a release version.",
    "body_html_line": 1,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [],
    "id": "UPDATE-B003",
    "source_id": "HELP-UPDATING-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "h2",
    "text": "Automatic updates",
    "body_html_line": 1,
    "anchor": "h_01HFP5S8T7VQH6XCQYWPST1VNJ",
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Automatic updates",
        "body_html_line": 1,
        "anchor": "h_01HFP5S8T7VQH6XCQYWPST1VNJ"
      }
    ],
    "id": "UPDATE-B004",
    "source_id": "HELP-UPDATING-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "li",
    "text": "Open Live's Preferences → Licenses/Maintenance or Licenses & Updates",
    "body_html_line": 2,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Automatic updates",
        "body_html_line": 1,
        "anchor": "h_01HFP5S8T7VQH6XCQYWPST1VNJ"
      }
    ],
    "id": "UPDATE-B005",
    "source_id": "HELP-UPDATING-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "li",
    "text": "Under Maintenance → Get Automatic Updates, select Always.",
    "body_html_line": 4,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Automatic updates",
        "body_html_line": 1,
        "anchor": "h_01HFP5S8T7VQH6XCQYWPST1VNJ"
      }
    ],
    "id": "UPDATE-B006",
    "source_id": "HELP-UPDATING-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "For more help, visit Troubleshooting Automatic Updates.",
    "body_html_line": 6,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Automatic updates",
        "body_html_line": 1,
        "anchor": "h_01HFP5S8T7VQH6XCQYWPST1VNJ"
      }
    ],
    "id": "UPDATE-B007",
    "source_id": "HELP-UPDATING-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "h3",
    "text": "Compatibility after updates",
    "body_html_line": 6,
    "anchor": "h_01KHNH5JHP4B2AADM7S0TF0DQX",
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Automatic updates",
        "body_html_line": 1,
        "anchor": "h_01HFP5S8T7VQH6XCQYWPST1VNJ"
      },
      {
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Compatibility after updates",
        "body_html_line": 6,
        "anchor": "h_01KHNH5JHP4B2AADM7S0TF0DQX"
      }
    ],
    "id": "UPDATE-B008",
    "source_id": "HELP-UPDATING-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "Live Sets can be opened in the Live version in which they were created/saved, and any later version. However, please note:",
    "body_html_line": 6,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Automatic updates",
        "body_html_line": 1,
        "anchor": "h_01HFP5S8T7VQH6XCQYWPST1VNJ"
      },
      {
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Compatibility after updates",
        "body_html_line": 6,
        "anchor": "h_01KHNH5JHP4B2AADM7S0TF0DQX"
      }
    ],
    "id": "UPDATE-B009",
    "source_id": "HELP-UPDATING-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "li",
    "text": "Once Live has been updated, if you open and Save a Set, it can no longer be opened in an earlier version. This includes after updating (either automatically or manually) to a new minor or \"point\" version. For example, Sets saved in Live 12.2 cannot be opened in 12.1 or earlier.",
    "body_html_line": 7,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Automatic updates",
        "body_html_line": 1,
        "anchor": "h_01HFP5S8T7VQH6XCQYWPST1VNJ"
      },
      {
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Compatibility after updates",
        "body_html_line": 6,
        "anchor": "h_01KHNH5JHP4B2AADM7S0TF0DQX"
      }
    ],
    "id": "UPDATE-B010",
    "source_id": "HELP-UPDATING-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "li",
    "text": "After updating, you'l be prompted to save a new version of the Set to preserve compatibility. Learn more about Backward Compatibility.",
    "body_html_line": 8,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Automatic updates",
        "body_html_line": 1,
        "anchor": "h_01HFP5S8T7VQH6XCQYWPST1VNJ"
      },
      {
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Compatibility after updates",
        "body_html_line": 6,
        "anchor": "h_01KHNH5JHP4B2AADM7S0TF0DQX"
      }
    ],
    "id": "UPDATE-B011",
    "source_id": "HELP-UPDATING-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "h2",
    "text": "Manual Updates",
    "body_html_line": 10,
    "anchor": "01HFP6BBQ03SC5CPNDT2WW63FR",
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Manual Updates",
        "body_html_line": 10,
        "anchor": "01HFP6BBQ03SC5CPNDT2WW63FR"
      }
    ],
    "id": "UPDATE-B012",
    "source_id": "HELP-UPDATING-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "Sometimes it's necessary to update Live manually. To do this, visit your Ableton account to download and install the most current version. Detailed instructions are linked here:",
    "body_html_line": 10,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Manual Updates",
        "body_html_line": 10,
        "anchor": "01HFP6BBQ03SC5CPNDT2WW63FR"
      }
    ],
    "id": "UPDATE-B013",
    "source_id": "HELP-UPDATING-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "Installing Live",
    "body_html_line": 10,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Manual Updates",
        "body_html_line": 10,
        "anchor": "01HFP6BBQ03SC5CPNDT2WW63FR"
      }
    ],
    "id": "UPDATE-B014",
    "source_id": "HELP-UPDATING-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "To avoid accidental overwriting of an older set, Live will prompt you to save a new version, using the option \"Save as…” Make sure to save this version under a new name:",
    "body_html_line": 10,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Manual Updates",
        "body_html_line": 10,
        "anchor": "01HFP6BBQ03SC5CPNDT2WW63FR"
      }
    ],
    "id": "UPDATE-B015",
    "source_id": "HELP-UPDATING-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "h3",
    "text": "Updating Live 11.3 for Push 3 on Windows",
    "body_html_line": 10,
    "anchor": "h_01KHNH6HRDDHTJ11WE59GPY0MQ",
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Manual Updates",
        "body_html_line": 10,
        "anchor": "01HFP6BBQ03SC5CPNDT2WW63FR"
      },
      {
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Updating Live 11.3 for Push 3 on Windows",
        "body_html_line": 10,
        "anchor": "h_01KHNH6HRDDHTJ11WE59GPY0MQ"
      }
    ],
    "id": "UPDATE-B016",
    "source_id": "HELP-UPDATING-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "To install Push 3 drivers, install the current version of Live manually from your Ableton account, as described below. If Live 11.3.x is installed via auto-update, the Push 3 drivers may not be installed.",
    "body_html_line": 10,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Manual Updates",
        "body_html_line": 10,
        "anchor": "01HFP6BBQ03SC5CPNDT2WW63FR"
      },
      {
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Updating Live 11.3 for Push 3 on Windows",
        "body_html_line": 10,
        "anchor": "h_01KHNH6HRDDHTJ11WE59GPY0MQ"
      }
    ],
    "id": "UPDATE-B017",
    "source_id": "HELP-UPDATING-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "h3",
    "text": "Uninstalling Live",
    "body_html_line": 10,
    "anchor": "h_01KHNH852GBW7S5DAJPWPCAJFJ",
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Manual Updates",
        "body_html_line": 10,
        "anchor": "01HFP6BBQ03SC5CPNDT2WW63FR"
      },
      {
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Uninstalling Live",
        "body_html_line": 10,
        "anchor": "h_01KHNH852GBW7S5DAJPWPCAJFJ"
      }
    ],
    "id": "UPDATE-B018",
    "source_id": "HELP-UPDATING-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "It's not necessary to uninstall previous versions of Live before updating. However, if you wish to uninstall Live, you can follow these steps: Uninstalling Live (Mac) / Uninstalling Live (Windows).",
    "body_html_line": 10,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Manual Updates",
        "body_html_line": 10,
        "anchor": "01HFP6BBQ03SC5CPNDT2WW63FR"
      },
      {
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Uninstalling Live",
        "body_html_line": 10,
        "anchor": "h_01KHNH852GBW7S5DAJPWPCAJFJ"
      }
    ],
    "id": "UPDATE-B019",
    "source_id": "HELP-UPDATING-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "h2",
    "text": "Selecting the correct installer",
    "body_html_line": 10,
    "anchor": "h_01HFP5S8T7BPR2M8ZVXNVAFC5Y",
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Selecting the correct installer",
        "body_html_line": 10,
        "anchor": "h_01HFP5S8T7BPR2M8ZVXNVAFC5Y"
      }
    ],
    "id": "UPDATE-B020",
    "source_id": "HELP-UPDATING-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "Ableton.com will automatically detect the correct installer for your computer’s operating system. You can also select manually between different builds of Live 11, if needed. Here’s how to choose the right installation package for your system:",
    "body_html_line": 10,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Selecting the correct installer",
        "body_html_line": 10,
        "anchor": "h_01HFP5S8T7BPR2M8ZVXNVAFC5Y"
      }
    ],
    "id": "UPDATE-B021",
    "source_id": "HELP-UPDATING-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "h3",
    "text": "macOS Universal",
    "body_html_line": 10,
    "anchor": "h_01KADY88D3002QVXM0N7NHNAZM",
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Selecting the correct installer",
        "body_html_line": 10,
        "anchor": "h_01HFP5S8T7BPR2M8ZVXNVAFC5Y"
      },
      {
        "level": 3,
        "text": "macOS Universal",
        "body_html_line": 10,
        "anchor": "h_01KADY88D3002QVXM0N7NHNAZM"
      }
    ],
    "id": "UPDATE-B022",
    "source_id": "HELP-UPDATING-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "li",
    "text": "Apple silicon (M-series)",
    "body_html_line": 12,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Selecting the correct installer",
        "body_html_line": 10,
        "anchor": "h_01HFP5S8T7BPR2M8ZVXNVAFC5Y"
      },
      {
        "level": 3,
        "text": "macOS Universal",
        "body_html_line": 10,
        "anchor": "h_01KADY88D3002QVXM0N7NHNAZM"
      }
    ],
    "id": "UPDATE-B023",
    "source_id": "HELP-UPDATING-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "li",
    "text": "Apple Intel running macOS 10.14 Mojave or later",
    "body_html_line": 13,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Selecting the correct installer",
        "body_html_line": 10,
        "anchor": "h_01HFP5S8T7BPR2M8ZVXNVAFC5Y"
      },
      {
        "level": 3,
        "text": "macOS Universal",
        "body_html_line": 10,
        "anchor": "h_01KADY88D3002QVXM0N7NHNAZM"
      }
    ],
    "id": "UPDATE-B024",
    "source_id": "HELP-UPDATING-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "h3",
    "text": "macOS Intel-only",
    "body_html_line": 14,
    "anchor": "h_01KADY8GTNV4XHAMWXPFGKKDZB",
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Selecting the correct installer",
        "body_html_line": 10,
        "anchor": "h_01HFP5S8T7BPR2M8ZVXNVAFC5Y"
      },
      {
        "level": 3,
        "text": "macOS Intel-only",
        "body_html_line": 14,
        "anchor": "h_01KADY8GTNV4XHAMWXPFGKKDZB"
      }
    ],
    "id": "UPDATE-B025",
    "source_id": "HELP-UPDATING-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "The Intel build of Live 11 is for use on Intel-based Macs running macOS 10.13 High Sierra only.",
    "body_html_line": 15,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Selecting the correct installer",
        "body_html_line": 10,
        "anchor": "h_01HFP5S8T7BPR2M8ZVXNVAFC5Y"
      },
      {
        "level": 3,
        "text": "macOS Intel-only",
        "body_html_line": 14,
        "anchor": "h_01KADY8GTNV4XHAMWXPFGKKDZB"
      }
    ],
    "id": "UPDATE-B026",
    "source_id": "HELP-UPDATING-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "Note: Running Live (Universal) as an Intel application",
    "body_html_line": 15,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Selecting the correct installer",
        "body_html_line": 10,
        "anchor": "h_01HFP5S8T7BPR2M8ZVXNVAFC5Y"
      },
      {
        "level": 3,
        "text": "macOS Intel-only",
        "body_html_line": 14,
        "anchor": "h_01KADY8GTNV4XHAMWXPFGKKDZB"
      }
    ],
    "id": "UPDATE-B027",
    "source_id": "HELP-UPDATING-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "li",
    "text": "You can force Live to run as an Intel application via Rosetta 2 on a Mac with Apple silicon, as explained in the guide How to open Live using Rosetta on macOS. However, this isn't necessary if your plug-ins are updated to run natively on Apple Silicon. Please check the latest Apple silicon and macOS compatibility information provided by each plug-in developer.",
    "body_html_line": 15,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Selecting the correct installer",
        "body_html_line": 10,
        "anchor": "h_01HFP5S8T7BPR2M8ZVXNVAFC5Y"
      },
      {
        "level": 3,
        "text": "macOS Intel-only",
        "body_html_line": 14,
        "anchor": "h_01KADY8GTNV4XHAMWXPFGKKDZB"
      }
    ],
    "id": "UPDATE-B028",
    "source_id": "HELP-UPDATING-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "h3",
    "text": "Windows",
    "body_html_line": 15,
    "anchor": "h_01KADZ7QMCC78NEBX7ADQ2VJCF",
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Selecting the correct installer",
        "body_html_line": 10,
        "anchor": "h_01HFP5S8T7BPR2M8ZVXNVAFC5Y"
      },
      {
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Windows",
        "body_html_line": 15,
        "anchor": "h_01KADZ7QMCC78NEBX7ADQ2VJCF"
      }
    ],
    "id": "UPDATE-B029",
    "source_id": "HELP-UPDATING-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "The Windows 64-bit download package is supported for all compatible PCs and Windows OS versions. Learn more about Windows Compatibility with Live.",
    "body_html_line": 16,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Selecting the correct installer",
        "body_html_line": 10,
        "anchor": "h_01HFP5S8T7BPR2M8ZVXNVAFC5Y"
      },
      {
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Windows",
        "body_html_line": 15,
        "anchor": "h_01KADZ7QMCC78NEBX7ADQ2VJCF"
      }
    ],
    "id": "UPDATE-B030",
    "source_id": "HELP-UPDATING-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "h3",
    "text": "Installing multiple versions",
    "body_html_line": 16,
    "anchor": "h_01KADZ6FJATER380N9CCCK5AW8",
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Selecting the correct installer",
        "body_html_line": 10,
        "anchor": "h_01HFP5S8T7BPR2M8ZVXNVAFC5Y"
      },
      {
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Installing multiple versions",
        "body_html_line": 16,
        "anchor": "h_01KADZ6FJATER380N9CCCK5AW8"
      }
    ],
    "id": "UPDATE-B031",
    "source_id": "HELP-UPDATING-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "To install multiple versions of Live, follow the steps here: Installing multiple versions of Live.",
    "body_html_line": 16,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Selecting the correct installer",
        "body_html_line": 10,
        "anchor": "h_01HFP5S8T7BPR2M8ZVXNVAFC5Y"
      },
      {
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Installing multiple versions",
        "body_html_line": 16,
        "anchor": "h_01KADZ6FJATER380N9CCCK5AW8"
      }
    ],
    "id": "UPDATE-B032",
    "source_id": "HELP-UPDATING-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "h2",
    "text": "Updating Live 11",
    "body_html_line": 16,
    "anchor": "h_01HFP5S8T7VXEW1ZVSG0PWZXQJ",
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Updating Live 11",
        "body_html_line": 16,
        "anchor": "h_01HFP5S8T7VXEW1ZVSG0PWZXQJ"
      }
    ],
    "id": "UPDATE-B033",
    "source_id": "HELP-UPDATING-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "Once Live 11.1.x has been installed, your version will be updated automatically if automatic updates are enabled as described above.",
    "body_html_line": 16,
    "anchor": null,
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Updating Live 11",
        "body_html_line": 16,
        "anchor": "h_01HFP5S8T7VXEW1ZVSG0PWZXQJ"
      }
    ],
    "id": "UPDATE-B034",
    "source_id": "HELP-UPDATING-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "h3",
    "text": "How to update from Live 11.0.12 or earlier",
    "body_html_line": 16,
    "anchor": "h_01HFP5S8T7B5CMJB1F2144FHW2",
    "heading_context": [
      {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Updating Live 11",
        "body_html_line": 16,
        "anchor": "h_01HFP5S8T7VXEW1ZVSG0PWZXQJ"
      },
      {
        "level": 3,
        "text": "How to update from Live 11.0.12 or earlier",
        "body_html_line": 16,
        "anchor": "h_01HFP5S8T7B5CMJB1F2144FHW2"
      }
    ],
    "id": "UPDATE-B035",
    "source_id": "HELP-UPDATING-API",
    "source_pointer": "/article/body"
  },
  {
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "To update from Live 11.0.x, you must install the current version manually via Ableton.com. If your installed version is Live 11.0.12 or earlier, Live 11.1 or later will not update automatically, even if Automatic Updates are enabled in Live's Preferences. Login to your Ableton account for the link to download and Install the current version of Live.",
    "body_html_line": 16,
    "anchor": null,
